<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Password Reset OTP</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .otp-code {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #007bff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .note {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
        <p>You have requested to reset your password. Please use the following OTP code to proceed with your password reset:</p>
        
        <div class="otp-code">
            {{code}}
        </div>
        
        <p>This OTP will expire in 5 minutes for security reasons.</p>
        
        <div class="note">
            <p>If you did not request this password reset, please ignore this email or contact support if you have concerns.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>L-Edu Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
